{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-09_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-09",
  "title": "徹入骨髓",
  "storyCode": "4-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fb898a9eb5d1b037acbc6c4aa11ce06af6082c4bde423c2888ac0f6a728ef550",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "隕星......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "潔西卡究竟看到了什麼......？你們也在一起嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......你最好還是不知道為妙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "不是什麼戰略上的問題......就先別關心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "還想藏到什麼時候呢？羅德島的小蟲子們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（——！梅菲斯特！他發現我們的蹤跡了嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "（別出聲。還沒有，這是他慣用的伎倆。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "啊，啊，不想出來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "別以為我沒看見你們增援的隊伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "也罷。算了，我有些東西要給你們看。你們會喜歡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "說起來——自一開始，我們就是要接管整個切爾諾伯格......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "等待，等待，等待了那麼久......終於等到這個時刻——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這個向烏薩斯、向迫害我們感染者的人復仇的時刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "然而，這個分城的這些傢伙呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他們逃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他們反應很快。在我們動手之前，就逃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "解開了地區鎖，開足了馬力，動用一切移動手段——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但他們又能逃到哪裡去呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我們的同胞，早就在各個城區中潛伏著，尋找著機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "最終他們被我們追上，得到了應有的懲罰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這些懦夫，這些施暴者，我們該怎麼處理他們呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "當然是——讓他們成為一個標誌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "一個宣告感染者身上的一切不公，終將被摧毀的標誌——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "——沒錯，那就是，整合運動的標誌——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "讓它們一個個都成為恐怖的象徵吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們，去點燃那個標誌！照亮周圍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "來吧，照亮這個城市吧！讓羅德島看看軟弱的壓迫者們的末路！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "（——不！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（迅速掩住阿米婭的雙眼）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士——？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別看！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "那是......惡毒和瘋狂堆成的焚爐。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士。請挪開你的手。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我沒問題的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "——不，你必須讓我看見。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "他的行為總有一天，是我需要面對的，更何況以前也……",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（鬆開手）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "為什麼......為什麼......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "潔西卡，冷靜點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "——可惡！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "......真是作孽......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "那些焦臭味......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "............",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "你們還要躲多久呢，切爾諾伯格的那隻兔子？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "剛才你們幾個就悄悄摸摸的，我還以為你們要做什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "結果也只能默默看著嗎......真的很無趣呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "看來，你還帶了不少人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "這些，都是你做的嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "當然了——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "不運用恐怖的手段，如何減少損失呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "只要十分之一的人的死——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "就能恐嚇住剩下十分之九的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "這可是，最有效的減少傷亡的措施呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "——————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "——博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我已經不是當時的我了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "雖然你不記得——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "是的，當時的我又膽小又脆弱，很容易就感到害怕......依靠著你，我才能向前走——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "也許我看上去依然是那副模樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "但現在的我，見過的慘劇已經夠多了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我當然不想再看到這種事情發生",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......但不去面對它們是不行的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "因為我要提醒自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我還不能退後——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我還要繼續戰鬥下去!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
